\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, let all Thy lovers shine 
\par Illustrious as the sun:
\par And, bright with borrowed rays divine,
\par Their glorious circuit run.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Beyond the reach of mortals, spread
\par Their light whe'er they go;
\par And heaven influences shed
\par On all the world below.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. As the bright Sun of Righteousness,
\par Their healing wings display;
\par And let their lustre still increase
\par Unto the perfect day.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

